#
# PING - baseline
#
PONG
#
# ECHO - short arg, with spaces, empty string, digit-like arg
#
hello
with spaces

12345
#
# CONFIG GET - Rondis returns the parameter name paired with an
# empty array (divergent from real Redis, which returns
# name/value pairs). Any parameter name is accepted.
#
maxmemory

save

does-not-exist

#
# SELECT - valid database (Rondis exposes at least db 0)
#
OK
